# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 8 (a widget application is transparent: its places are its caller's, in line order; its parameters bind as patterns do) and ch. 7 (a dynamic's readers move in the tick it moves; a hold's write lands in the tick of the firing): the bundle inside the value the function gives holds the caller's event and dynamic, which the name hands on and the inner widget's pattern names.
test the_bundle_inside_binds

